  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Budget and Financial Accountability - Argentina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Budget and Financial Accountability Team has partnered with the Argentine Ministry of Hacienda through an intermittent technical assistance project to develop the next generation of open budget and fiscal transparency tools. The Budget and Financial Accountability Team will provide ongoing technical assistance to the Argentine MOH functional and technical team in its efforts to provide detailed government financial and non-financial data to the public via its current web sites.</narrative>
  </description>
